{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"Blakers–Massey 定理"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Blakers–Massey定理"},0],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"同伦论","text":"同伦论"}}]},4],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>若采取 “高连通度 = 小” 的直观 (见 "},{"Local":{"url":"Goodwillie演算","text":"Goodwillie 演算"}},{"Plain":"), 那么 Blakers–Massey 定理说的是: 在一个小邻域内, 推出近乎于拉回.</p>\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<p>考虑 "},{"Local":{"url":"Ani","text":"$\\mathsf{Ani}$"}},{"Plain":" 中的如下"},{"Local":{"url":"推出","text":"推出"}},{"Plain":"图,\n$$\r\n\\begin{CD}\r\nA @&gt;{f}&gt;&gt; B \\\\\r\n@V{g}VV @VVV \\\\\r\nC @&gt;&gt;&gt; D\r\n\\end{CD}\r\n$$\n若 $f$ 是 $m$-"},{"Local":{"url":"连通性","text":"连通"}},{"Plain":"映射, $g$ 是 $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"连通性","text":"连通"}},{"Plain":"映射, 则\n$$\r\nA \\to B\\times_D C\r\n$$\n是 $(m+n)$-连通映射.</p>\n<h3>在模态中的推广</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"ABFJ-BM","text":"ABFJ"}},{"Plain":" 的文章给出了 Blakers–Massey 定理的推广:</p>\n<p><strong>定理</strong>. 设 $(L,R)$ 是意象中的"},{"Local":{"url":"模态","text":"模态"}},{"Plain":" (即关于"},{"Local":{"url":"基变换","text":"基变换"}},{"Plain":"封闭的"},{"Local":{"url":"正交分解系","text":"正交分解系"}},{"Plain":"), 考虑"},{"Local":{"url":"推出","text":"推出"}},{"Plain":"图\n$$\r\n\\begin{CD}\r\nA @&gt;{f}&gt;&gt; B \\\\\r\n@V{g}VV @VVV \\\\\r\nC @&gt;&gt;&gt; D,\r\n\\end{CD}\r\n$$\n若"},{"Local":{"url":"对角线","text":"对角线"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"推出积","text":"推出积"}},{"Plain":" $\\Delta_f \\operatorname{\\square}_Z \\Delta_g$ 属于 $L$, 则映射 $A \\to B\\times_D C$ 属于 $L$.</p>\n<h2>证明</h2>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>取 $B = C = *$, 则有 $D = \\Sigma A$, 而拉回为 $*\\times_{\\Sigma A} * = \\Omega \\Sigma A$. 我们得到 "},{"Local":{"url":"Freudenthal纬悬定理","text":"Freudenthal 纬悬定理"}},{"Plain":": 对于 $n$-连通空间 $A$, $A\\to\\Omega\\Sigma A$ 是 $2n$-连通映射.</p>\n"}]}}